 "stimulus_html": "Use the figure to answer the following exercises. Identify the graph or graphs with the given characteristic.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/d08b6b4a081c1d6d.png\" alt=\"Four graphs. Graph 5 has six vertices: p, q, r, s, t, and u. The edges connect p q, q r, p t, r t, s t, and t u. Graph 6 has 7 vertices: a, b, c, d, e, f, and g. All the edges are interconnected. Graph 7 has 8 vertices: h, i, j, k, m, n, o, and p. The edges connect p i, i m, m p, o h, h j, j k, k n, and n o. Graph 8 has 9 vertices: q, r, s, t, u, v, w, x, and y. The edges connect q r, r s, s v v y, y x, x w, w t, t q, q x, and r v.\">\n\n",
